                              <fo:block>
Provide the version of the given package name.
 
 The version is encoded by prefixing the given package name with
 {@link RemoteConstants#ENDPOINT_PACKAGE_VERSION_ endpoint.package.version.}, and then using this as an endpoint property
 key. For example:
 
 </fo:block>
