                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
The action string {@code import}. The {@code import} action implies the
 {@code read} action.
   </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.remoteserviceadmin.EndpointPermission.READ">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
