                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
Endpoint property identifying the id for this endpoint. This service
 property must always be set.
 
 </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
