                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
Endpoint property identifying the service id of the exported service. Can
 be absent or 0 if the corresponding endpoint is not for an OSGi service.
 
 </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 The value of this property must be of type {@code Long}.</fo:block>
               </fo:block>
