                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
The capability attribute used to specify the policy or policies supported
 by this topology manager. The value of this attribute must be of type
 {@code String} or {@code List&lt;String&gt;}. Policy names are typically
 implementation specific, however the Remote Services Specification
 defines the <fo:inline font-style="italic">promiscuous</fo:inline> and <fo:inline font-style="italic">fail-over</fo:inline> policies for
 common use cases.
   </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
